    <div class="oa-container">
        <a href="/" class="logo"><img
            src="data:image/png;base64,"
            alt="OANDA Logo"></a>

        <h1>Sorry, there's a problem on our side</h1>
        <h4>We are aware of this problem and are working to fix it.</h4>

        <p><strong>In the meantime, here is what you can do:</strong></p>

        <ul>
            <li><i class="material-icons">autorenew</i> Refresh the page (sometimes this helps)</li>
            <li><i class="material-icons">access_time</i> Try again in 30 minutes</li>
            <li><i class="material-icons">help</i> Visit our <a href="https://help.oanda.com" target="_blank"
                                                                rel="noopener">support site</a> and tell us what
                happened
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h3>You can still use the following services</h3>

        <div class="content-cards content-cards--equal-height content-cards--align-top">
            <div class="content-cards__card">
                <div
