                            <h3>Existing client?</h3>
                        </div>

                        <div class="content-cards__card__content-block content-cards__card__content-block--text">
                            <div class="rich-text"><p>Log in to the portal to deposit or withdraw funds to/from your
                                OANDA account.</p></div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="content-cards__card__content-block content-cards__card__content-block--ctas">
                            <div class="button-group">
                                <a href="https://www.oanda.com/account/login" class="btn btn--primary btn--blue"
                                   target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sign in</a>
                            </div>
